  "ruleText": "Rev 2501.14 “Tax payment (TXP)” means the banking convention record format for taxpayers to pay state taxes through the ACH method.\n\nSource. #6639, eff 11-27-97, EXPIRED 11-27-05\n\nNew. #8495, eff 11-30-05; ss by #10484, eff 12-5-13 (from Rev 2501.14); ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (formerly Rev 2501.15) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)",
